# The speaker-identification beta's native library and model are too large for this repository (over the 5 MiB
# private-material limit). They are copied in by hand; only the two READMEs and the xcconfig template are committed.
# The repository's own "models/" rule also matches Models/ on a case-insensitive disk, so it is re-included here first.
!Models/
Models/*
!Models/README.md
Frameworks/*
!Frameworks/README.md
!Frameworks/Sherpa.xcconfig.template
